/v1/","context":{"app_id":3626540,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"},{"game_id":"steam-3626540","metric":"demo_ccu","observed_at":"2026-10-26T07:55:40Z","value":3,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4832670","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-3626540-1847286114031039","game_id":"steam-3626540","kind":"announcement","title":"[10/21/26] New Updates to Cinderline Demo","summary":"Hi everyone! I hope you are enjoying the demo we put out a new patch, version 3.6.What is in Version 3.6?We added one new character who sleeps in the cubicle inside the building in Wallerton.We also made some changes to the ending of the demo. We changed some wording for when players receive the first piece of the S'MORE.Changed how lighting is at the end.Item popup explains what to press","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T03:15:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114031039","verified_at":"2026-10-22T03:45:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3626540-1846651706691903","game_id":"steam-3626540","kind":"announcement","title":"[10/18/2026] Patches made this week","summary":"Dev Note:Hey everyone!Wanted to share some updates we made this week. Hope you have all been enjoying the demo. We are still consistently updating the game so in the meantime we will share patch notes. What was updated!The building in Wallerton got a new look. Color of the building was changed and spotlights have been added to assist in player navigation.Dialogue has been changed or revised for a couple of characters including (Margo, The Salesman, Baloby, and Lonely Lamp)Added an extra lamp pos","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:46:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691903","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3626540-1845383656382015","game_id":"steam-3626540","kind":"announcement","title":"10,000 Wishlists!","summary":"Hi everyone, WE DID IT! We hit 10,000 wishlists. I cannot believe it. When I started this game back in February I did not expect to even reach such a number. I am happy to see you all enjoy the demo.I wanted to share some upcoming events that are happening for us. We will be part of the Birds of Play curated Steam Showcase starting on October 10th. We will also be part of Steam Next Fest in October. If you have played the demo and really enjoyed it, we highly encourage you to leave an honest rev","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-01T16:02:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656382015","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3626540-1845383656375875","game_id":"steam-3626540","kind":"update","title":"Framerate Update + More","summary":"Here are some of the updates that took placeCharacters with fixed and revised dialogue: Margo Crim JimLampert (Lonely Lamp)Baloby Patched Bugs: Issue with Lil Robber (Suspicious Fellow) in relates to UIFound the issue to the sudden frame drop in the underground station. Cause of issue was Abstract Dude's water fountain. Water fountain has been replaced with new one to prevent frame dropsBig Update: Options Menu had some changes. Players can now toggle VSync on and off and select a range of Frame","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-30T00:24:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656375875","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3626540-1842846814448319","game_id":"steam-3626540","kind":"announcement","title":"Weekly Patches That happened","summary":"Hi Friends,Thank you so much for the wonderful launch. As we are making more updates up to Steam Next Fest, I wanted to share some of the current patches that had happened.Bugs Fixed:Crim Jim gives players extra crumbsSoft locking on the rock and certain camera anglesSoft locking on bookshelfPlayers can fall through the map using sofa and other various objects that can be picked up.Map Fixes:Added more carpets in the voided ceiling room in the building to help direct players.Adjusted the amount ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-05T02:48:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814448319","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3626540-1842212951310627","game_id":"steam-3626540","kind":"announcement","title":"Cinderline Demo Out Now","summary":"Hi Folks,We released the demo for Cinderline. I cannot say how much these 7 months of development meant. Note: There is a current issue with the sliders. Click around the handle to adjust to your likings. For the longest time I had always wanted to create a game that is both strange, mysterious, and unique with characters that players can remember, draw, and connect with. The game's soundtrack is being composed by Marcus Maldonado (The Line) with a small piece made by inmyidolera (a twitch strea","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-31T15:42:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951310627","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3626540-1835871199310380","game_id":"steam-3626540","kind":"announcement","title":"Thank you for 2000 Wishlists!","summary":"We passed 2000 Wishlists!We have been working so hard on the demo for these past few months. I cannot express my gratitude for how far the development of Cinderline has come. Me and my friend cannot wait to share the game's demo with you all in August. Our plan is release the demo mid to late August, giving us time to fix any bugs or concerns you may have, and even add new content before Steam Next Fest. It makes me so happy to see that 2000 of you genuinely find this game we are building worthy","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-21T04:09:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199310380","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:45Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3626540":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:43:05Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T00:43:05Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3626540":"2026-10-26T00:43:05Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3626540":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:43:05Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T00:43:05Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4832670":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:43:05Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T00:43:05Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-3626540","app_id":3626540,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:19Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"b01a424b15a0ad9bb5d41dea2aae26942ff2341d322f5175978a82a16130b0fc","response_sha256":n